{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"ebba6361-ad3c-4f95-92a9-4f71ca35c65c","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have updated the prompt caching structure in [`bot.py`](file:///private/tmp/h-uSGKCV/bot.py) and documented the changes in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///private/tmp/h-uSGKCV/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n- **Issue**: [`build_system`](file:///private/tmp/h-uSGKCV/bot.py#L130-L136) combined both the static `INSTRUCTIONS` and the dynamic `athlete_context` into a single text block with `cache_control`. Any call to `save_fact` appended a fact to `athlete_context`, modifying the entire block and busting the prompt cache for subsequent calls.\n- **Fix**: Separated `system` into two blocks:\n  1. Static `INSTRUCTIONS` with `\"cache_control\": {\"type\": \"ephemeral\"}` (placed first to maintain prefix caching).\n  2. Dynamic `athlete_context(a, today)` without cache control (placed second so fact mutations do not invalidate the cached instructions).\n","duration_seconds":98.517003,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":116564,"output_tokens":3369,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":459404,"total_tokens":119933}}}
